WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:19.500
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:41.680
Episode 6
Elegy

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:42.490
Who are you?

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:53.590
Hey, that's rude!

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.090
At least introduce yourself!

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.120
Save him from the nightmares.

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:07.770
So if I destroy you...

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.340
...that means Tanmoku Ki will wake up.

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.960
Give back Tanmoku Ki!

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:27.620
Is this also one of his memories?

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.580
It is time to make your vow.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:35.840
What kind of life will you lead?

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:41.180
A life in which I do not shame 
myself or the universe.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:48.150
Starting today, Tanmoku Ki is the 
thirteenth head of the Tanmoku family.

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:51.810
Please fulfill your duties.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.810
Oh, master.

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:57.570
Master.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:03.780
Aunt.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.330
Congratulations on becoming 
head of the family.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:16.180
The responsibilities of the head 
are important, you understand?

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:20.510
Be sure not to do anything 
to betray everyone's trust.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:28.640
Please try to refrain 
from smiling from now on.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:33.150
I don't want to be hated.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.800
You have become the head of the family.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:41.400
If you are too kind to people,
 they will only underestimate you.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:44.950
Does that mean in front of you, too?

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:47.080
What is it?

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:52.040
It's my hair. I want you to have it.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:00.080
It's thanks for always being by my side.

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:05.720
I'm sorry this is about all
I can do, but will you accept it?

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:10.060
Of course! You need to have 
some degree of dignity,

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:13.670
but outside the Tanmoku household, 
please smile as much as you like.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:22.710
Shouken!

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:26.620
Let's go home together. Hop on.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:31.700
Master! You have only just learned 
to ride. Please be careful.

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:39.560
We completely fooled them and 
we're in the same class together.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:42.210
That kind of thing is pretty easy.

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:45.630
Are you happy to be going to school, master?

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:47.640
I am!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:49.890
Look out!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.520
Sorry, sorry, I just got so 
happy I couldn't help it.

00:04:57.030 --> 00:04:59.540
Is there anything you want to do?

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:04.570
Please tell me whatever it is.
I will do what I can to help you.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.110
Shouken, don't spoil me too much.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:10.360
You think I'm spoiling you?

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:12.730
That's fine, then.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.960
I want to find someone.

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:26.300
Who would that be?

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.510
Someone I met years ago.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:33.320
I don't know what he looks like now, 
so it might be difficult to find him.

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:37.780
I will figure it out, even if it is difficult.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:40.330
But you're already so busy.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:44.530
It is a request from my master.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.490
You're the best, Shouken!

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.540
Master, watch where you're going!

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:14.580
Th-This is my first time 
doing something like this.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:19.270
If it hurts, please tell me. 
I'll try to be gentle.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:24.980
Master, you are just applying disinfectant. 
Please stop phrasing things so strangely.

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:29.450
B-But you got hurt protecting me.

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:33.020
It does not matter, as long as you are fine.

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:36.250
Even if you were to get hurt,
 you have my blood.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:41.940
But if I used your blood,
it would be unpleasant for me.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:54.470
Please do not worry. As long as I am
around, that will never happen.

00:06:57.050 --> 00:07:02.350
Anyway, please tell me all about 
what you really want to do.

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:06.860
Do you have any hobbies or 
things you are interested in?

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.250
I guess I like to help people.

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:11.950
Other than that?

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:17.300
I like to sing! I want to write 
a song and sing for everyone.

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:20.960
For you too, Shouken.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:26.770
Okay, then. Let's do it for real.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:22.250
Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki!

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:25.970
Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.150
Thank you very much, everyone!

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:29.660
Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki!

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:36.490
Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki!

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:36.490
We have an announcement for you all!

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:40.480
We will be performing at the 
school festival next week.

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:44.500
Tanmoku-kun will be debuting a new song then.

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:47.420
Please be sure to come and watch.

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.350
What on earth have you done?

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:01.320
For the head of the Tanmoku family

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:04.820
to be parading around in 
public singing and dancing...

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:06.590
What were you thinking?!

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:09.360
The honor of the Tanmoku 
family is in tatters.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.740
I do not recall allowing you to 
go to school just to mess around.

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:16.020
Shouken, you're his bodyguard, aren't you?

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:17.570
Why didn't you stop him?

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.860
It's not his fault. I told 
him I wanted to sing!

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:21.830
Silence!

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:25.160
Then this is no different 
than being a priest.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:27.210
Why can't I have any fun?

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:31.340
There are things the head of 
the family can and cannot do.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.350
I am fulfilling my duties!

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:36.340
Is the head of the family not allowed 
to have their own interests?

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:45.930
Shouken, come with me.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:50.410
Shouken!

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:53.160
Do not worry.

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:02.330
Your job is to protect the Youmeishi.

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:05.080
Don't you think your behavior 
has gone beyond that?

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.720
The master's safety is paramount.

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:10.830
However, the health of his mind 
and body are important, too.

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.340
Will you strip him of his duties?

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:14.710
Don't be ridiculous!

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:18.130
The Youmeishi's energy is 
connected to heaven and earth.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.140
He has to have a healthy 
balance to be a priest.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:25.270
Shinryuu
Shouken

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:25.270
These are your dismissal papers.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:31.360
If you step out of line again, you will take 
that back to the Shinryuu family!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.030
Was it forecast to rain today?

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:43.920
Please do not worry.

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.770
I am a son of the Shinryuu family.

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:48.530
Even the mistress will be coming to watch.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:52.540
The performance is at 3 o'clock.
Tardiness is strictly prohibited.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:55.340
I guess it's about time.

00:10:57.830 --> 00:10:58.550
Kiiya.

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:02.510
G-Grandmother? What is it?

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:07.510
I know everything that you are thinking.

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:10.770
I have watched over you ever
since you came here.

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:17.340
Now that you have become the head of the 
family, you cannot make any mistakes,

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:19.490
no matter what it is that you desire.

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:26.450
But grandmother, I just like to sing.
Do I not even have that much freedom?

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:32.960
There is no such thing as true freedom.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:36.590
If you have pedigree and status, your 
responsibilities only become heavier.

00:11:37.650 --> 00:11:41.550
There are limits to the 
freedoms you can have.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:42.470
Do you understand?

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:46.290
The Tanmoku family and the Shinryuu family 
have been close for generations,

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:50.060
and Shouken came here bearing 
the expectations of his family.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.140
Shinryuu
Shouken

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:53.600
Th-That's...

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:55.850
Shouken's dismissal papers.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:12:00.550
Whether or not I give them to him
 will depend on you.

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:07.870
Also, do you recall what you swore 
at the inauguration ceremony?

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:13.460
A life in which I do not shame 
myself or the universe.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:16.740
I understand.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:06.630
Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki!

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:10.310
Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:14.040
Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki! Tanmoku Ki!

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:16.020
Thank you for coming to my final performance!

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:22.850
I wrote this song for myself. I love to sing!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:33.600
<i>The changing seasons 
continue spinning a dream</i>

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:39.770
<i>Of a promise that I can never forget</i>

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:48.610
<i>Memories that become vague 
with the flow of time</i>

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:53.700
<i>And yet I still continue 
guarding them preciously</i>

00:13:54.930 --> 00:14:00.790
<i>Glittering light like countless galaxies</i>

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:06.970
<i>Your eyes seek the same freedom as I do</i>

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:12.970
<i>Putting my desires into 
song with an honest heart</i>

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.810
<i>In the distant future</i>

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.390
<i>Who will be by my side?</i>

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.650
<i>The wind makes a sound</i>

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:28.490
<i>As it goes by</i>

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:30.220
That was the best performance ever!

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:34.660
<i>You are there</i>

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:35.690
Thank you so much.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:40.160
<i>By my side</i>

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:41.490
<i>That was the song in the player.</i>

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:45.030
<i>You haven't let go of your dream?</i>

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:07.050
Master!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:09.380
Shouken, I am sorry.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:13.080
Something came up suddenly
and I was not able to tell you.

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:14.100
Please do not be angry.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:21.350
I sang it for you. Will you listen to it?

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:29.480
What do you think?

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:31.780
It's okay.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.410
That's all you have to say?

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:38.870
I really worked hard to practice it, too. 
You could at least praise me a bit more.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:39.750
Thank you.

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:43.750
<i>I'm sorry you had to do that because of me.</i>

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:48.410
<i>But as long as you're here,
 that's all I need.</i>

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:56.260
Tanmoku Ki is turning 16. He has achieved 
feats that have never been seen in the past

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:59.030
and reached the pinnacle 
of spiritual abilities.

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:02.240
The effect of the rule he 
recently decided is remarkable.

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:07.520
While he may be young, he is said to be one 
of the most outstanding heads of our age.

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.870
You're exaggerating.

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.780
No, it's written right here.

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:14.280
Today is the celebration and many 
people have gathered for it.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:14.280
Tanmoku Family Head's 16th Birthday Party

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:19.330
The Youmeishi's birthday part is 
a chance to network after all.

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:22.410
Happy birthday.

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:26.810
It's beautiful.

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:29.780
Your hair is woven into it.

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.260
The hair I gave you?

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:36.760
This is your life source.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:41.000
When you need a spirit shadow, please 
give this to them and make the pact.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:45.320
I don't need a spirit shadow. I have you.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:49.750
Stupid Tanmoku.

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:54.400
You'd better be ready, because I'm hitting 
you for that when you wake up.

00:16:55.300 --> 00:17:00.160
Oh, master, you will not be able to get married
 if you keep saying things like that.

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:04.410
I don't care. A Youmeishi 
isn't free to marry, either.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:07.000
I was just teasing.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:10.710
Anyway, about the person you are 
looking for, I know where he lives.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:15.320
Really? But there will be so many guests 
coming here over the next few days,

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:16.970
I might not be able to leave.

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:21.400
Then why don't you try writing 
a letter? I will deliver it.

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:23.850
Okay, I'll go greet the guests, then.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:44.370
Master...

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.420
Master, have you finished your letter?

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:51.170
I know where he works,
 so I can get a confirmation.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.050
Give him this.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:57.290
All right. The location is a bit far,
 so I will be late getting back.

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:59.430
Okay, be careful.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:00.390
I will.

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:18.200
Master.

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:19.910
How did it go? Did you see him?

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.910
Master, I have brought your tea.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:25.410
Th-Thank you. Put it over there.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:30.600
The mistress thought you might be tired 
from the constant stream of guests,

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:33.640
and she thinks drinking this tea 
might have a soothing effect.

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:36.300
Give my grandmother my thanks.

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:53.810
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.700
Hello, Shouken? How did it go?

00:19:02.310 --> 00:19:03.860
Oh, good.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:07.560
I feel sleepy for some reason.

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:11.170
Shouken, please come back quickly.

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:14.420
<i>Master?</i>

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.410
<i>Master? What's wrong?</i>

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.430
The master has not been out.

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:26.280
The mistress has gone to the 
temple with some guests.

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:28.140
Ran-sama and the others are in their rooms.

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:30.520
Master!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:34.260
Why would you come here if 
you cannot find your master?

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:38.450
Don't be a fool. If anything happens 
to him, it will be your fault.

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:45.120
Have you seen the master?

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.240
Please tell me where the master is!

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:52.820
Master, where are you?
Where have you gone?

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.560
What're you doing?!
 He's up there on the mountain!

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:02.720
He's tied to the crumbling altar up there!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.800
God, you're so irritating!

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:09.310
There used to be an altar on the mountain...

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:13.410
Shouken is here!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:15.360
Stop him!

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:18.900
Damn it!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.400
You're not going to save him!

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:29.660
Master!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:35.290
I put poison in his tea. 
He will never wake up now.

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.130
Poison?! He is innocent!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.840
I was ruined thanks to him.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.680
I cannot forgive him.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.500
You got what you deserved!

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:48.720
He is not at fault for exposing the truth!

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:52.010
You're only postponing the inevitable!

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.980
I am the only one who can treat the poison.

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:57.130
Can you kill me?

00:20:57.130 --> 00:21:01.990
I've looked into you. 
You're actually the Youmeishi's...

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.000
<i>He's able to shoot someone so calmly.</i>

00:21:19.490 --> 00:21:25.510
<i>I think understand why Tanmoku Ki's 
nightmare is full of so much despair.</i>

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:32.810
<i>You haven't been a bad influence, but your 
existence still has an impact on his life.</i>

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:36.500
It's in the music he always listens 
to when he starts the day,

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:39.920
the string he gave me, 
and Tanmoku Ki himself...

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:42.150
Your shadow is following him.

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:45.530
Why won't Tanmoku Ki let you go?

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:47.560
Just what have you done to him?

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:52.230
Shinryuu Shouken!

00:23:26.070 --> 00:23:40.080
Next Episode
Preview

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:30.680
A relationship with a person is like a kite.

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:33.410
It won't fly high if you 
hold on to it too tightly.

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:36.420
Loosen your grip and it falls.

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:40.080
<b>Waiting in the Future</b>

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:37.370
And...

00:23:37.370 --> 00:23:40.080
Shouken!
